00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.390
And we will see how that continues

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.921
because that loosens financial conditions,

00:11:10.921 --> 00:11:12.600
makes it cheaper to borrow money,

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.970
makes companies more able to go out

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.310
